// Audit-mode ASR rules by devices affected
// Question: Which audit-mode ASR rules affect the fewest devices and are easiest to move to block?
// Tables:   DeviceEvents
// Workbook: Table - Building a Defender Security Dashboard with Workbooks, Part 3
//
// Author:   Seán O'Farrell - https://cloud-secure.ai/
// Runs as-is in Microsoft Defender advanced hunting.

DeviceEvents
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| where ActionType startswith "Asr" and ActionType endswith "Audited"
| summarize Events = count(), Devices = dcount(DeviceId), TopProcesses = make_set(InitiatingProcessFileName, 5) by Rule = ActionType
| order by Devices asc, Events asc
